<title>UK: TABLE - Tie Rack yr pretax profits up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Tie Rack yr pretax profits up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>For 53 weeks to February 2, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 10.73		 vs  9.87</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   2.75		 vs  N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   3.35		 vs  2.75</p>
<p> Pretax			 8.79		 vs  7.93</p>
<p> Turnover		   105.1		  vs 96.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it showed a net increase of 36 shops in the year, bringing the total to 415 in 27 countries. It said a further 12 shops had been opened so far this year.</p>
<p>Full company name of tie retailer - Tie Rack Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
